Source: Self-authored synthetic XLSX fixture and `generate_threaded_comments.py`, based on public OOXML package relationships and the MS-XLSX threaded-comment schema.
Notes: Includes schema-shaped child text elements, a wrong-namespace extension text element, an unused person record, workbook person relationship, authored thread messages, and a workbook-local defined name. Not exported by Excel or LibreOffice.
